{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CesXmk9d5jir3KuSpwVFa","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! I've completed a thorough search of the shipment feature files in the sample-service. Here's my comprehensive findings:\n\n## Shipment Feature Files Summary\n\n### 1. Main Directory Structure\nThe project is a Spring Boot application written in Kotlin, using Maven for build management:\n- **Location**: `/private/var/folders/jr/lwzz65cx5pndqqdgzhnym1pc0000gn/T/observatory-run-0d87df5c-ecab-4ba0-be76-7175b8535ade/sample-service`\n- **Source root**: `src/main/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample`\n- **Test root**: `src/test/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample`\n\n### 2. Shipment-Related Files (Production Code)\n\n**Entity/Model File:**\n- `/private/var/folders/jr/lwzz65cx5pndqqdgzhnym1pc0000gn/T/observatory-run-0d87df5c-ecab-4ba0-be76-7175b8535ade/sample-service/src/main/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/shipment/Shipment.kt`\n  - Contains the `Shipment` data class with fields: `shipmentId`, `orderId`, `carrier`, `status`\n  - Defines `ShipmentStatus` enum with states: CREATED, CONFIRMED, CANCELLED\n  - Defines `CreateShipmentRequest` data class for API requests\n\n**Controller/Endpoint File:**\n- `/private/var/folders/jr/lwzz65cx5pndqqdgzhnym1pc0000gn/T/observatory-run-0d87df5c-ecab-4ba0-be76-7175b8535ade/sample-service/src/main/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/shipment/ShipmentController.kt`\n  - REST controller at `/shipments` endpoint\n  - Implements endpoints:\n    - `POST /shipments` - Create shipment (returns 201 CREATED)\n    - `GET /shipments/{shipmentId}` - Retrieve single shipment\n    - `GET /shipments` - List all shipments\n\n**Repository File:**\n- `/private/var/folders/jr/lwzz65cx5pndqqdgzhnym1pc0000gn/T/observatory-run-0d87df5c-ecab-4ba0-be76-7175b8535ade/sample-service/src/main/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/shipment/ShipmentRepository.kt`\n  - Class: `InMemoryShipmentRepository` (in-memory storage)\n  - Methods: `save()`, `existsById()`, `findById()`, `findAll()`, `clear()`\n  - Uses ConcurrentHashMap for thread-safe storage\n\n### 3. Shipment-Related Test Files\n\n**Test File:**\n- `/private/var/folders/jr/lwzz65cx5pndqqdgzhnym1pc0000gn/T/observatory-run-0d87df5c-ecab-4ba0-be76-7175b8535ade/sample-service/src/test/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/shipment/ShipmentControllerTest.kt`\n  - Integration tests using MockMvc\n  - Test cases cover:\n    - Create shipment in CREATED status\n    - Reject duplicate shipment IDs (409 Conflict)\n    - Retrieve shipment by ID\n    - Handle unknown shipment (404 Not Found)\n    - List shipments sorted by ID\n\n### 4. Architecture Notes\n\n**Key Design Points:**\n- No separate service layer (controller directly uses repository)\n- In-memory repository for benchmark fixture compatibility\n- Uses Spring Boot 4.0.0 with Kotlin 2.2.21\n- Implements error handling with custom exceptions (`ConflictException`, `ResourceNotFoundException`)\n- Uses global exception handler for standardized error responses\n- Baseline feature: no way to confirm shipments (CONFIRMED status exists but is not exposed via API)\n\n**Related Components:**\n- API error handling in: `/private/var/folders/jr/lwzz65cx5pndqqdgzhnym1pc0000gn/T/observatory-run-0d87df5c-ecab-4ba0-be76-7175b8535ade/sample-service/src/main/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/api/` (ApiExceptions.kt, ApiError.kt, GlobalExceptionHandler.kt)"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":320,"cache_read_input_tokens":17136,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":320,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_016d8LqzDt53MdhXFhgWLRHx","session_id":"3df865a9-bff9-4b06-9e9a-69577513bf0d","uuid":"121119cb-de16-4672-b090-faa3f930ba9b","timestamp":"2026-09-09T08:14: